  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is night. Tom and Lily are in bed. The lamp is on. Pip is in his bed too. \"Tick, tock, tick, tock!\" \"What is that?\" asks Lily. \"I don't know,\" says Tom. Lily looks at Tom. \"Is it the clock on the wall?\" Tom looks at the clock. It is not the clock on the wall.",
      "Tom looks at the desk. The black computer is there. It is not the computer. Lily looks under the bed. She sees a blue box and a ball. \"It is not here,\" says Lily. \"Tick, tock!\" Pip is next to the cupboard. \"Woof, woof!\" says Pip.",
      "Tom opens the cupboard. There is a big red box. Tom picks up the box. Under the red box is a small clock. It is Grandpa's old clock. \"Tick, tock!\" says the clock. \"Good dog, Pip!\" says Lily. Tom puts the clock on the desk. Now Tom and Lily can sleep."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom and Lily hear tick-tock in the night. Pip finds an old clock under a red box in the cupboard.",
